{"review_id": "dea3bbe8259a734ea1d54578308f", "base_record_id": "159301888de2242f47aeb053", "pointer": "/steps/0/summary", "base_value": "大學部累計班排名前 85% 以內、碩博班總平均 80 分以上、操行 80 分以上且無校規懲處紀錄；學士、研究生。；多數課程以日語授課，學生可參加日語密集課程及一般學士班課程。", "base_value_sha256": "90b047ec8635434eae20758b5b65106f744919fc7d8926cdc58de521d979912e", "base_status": "contradicted", "expected_value_or_interpretation": "久留米大學2025/05/01公告：日語別科自2026年10月入學起停止招生，待在學生完成後廢止。東吳116學年度表仍列可修日語密集課程，兩者適用範圍有衝突；2027／2028交換是否另有日語課程須確認。此公告不代表一般學部／研究所交換全部取消。", "reason": "母校課程敘述與接待校停止別科招生公告衝突。", "source_url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "source_sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b", "source_locator": "2025/05/01 notice, Japanese and English main content", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-20T23:45:02.616341+00:00", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-20T23:50:38+00:00", "source_type": "official_host_and_mother_sources", "method": "bounded_admission_scope_comparison", "baseline_inventory": "output/data-verification-20261021/baseline", "whole_record_verified": false, "additional_sources": [{"url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/faculty/exchange-student/", "sha256": "20d7043317048c0c22a74bb749ea2dfb29e9bd9eb12ed51e7d670181f72b3318"}, {"url": "https://english.kurume-u.ac.jp/", "sha256": "a8a504e7a64aaf8c22ae022ac8d53ac863fb44a1e5b1e0c24883bacadb397306"}, {"url": "https://icae.scu.edu.tw/zh-hant/outbound-exchange/intl/2025-2026schools", "sha256": "88f14bff787da8c4dfb2b9f30777d3ab52cf6b76a01b826d61a7373f66277d63"}]}
{"review_id": "fb59f1a4302204554f5ab7435f44", "base_record_id": "159301888de2242f47aeb053", "pointer": "/steps/3/details/0", "base_value": "基本條件與授課規定：學士、研究生。；多數課程以日語授課，學生可參加日語密集課程及一般學士班課程。", "base_value_sha256": "6ee643ac100851f16b83b1d190497a716ee54e69087121e6dfe2cc1af7f19bc1", "base_status": "contradicted", "expected_value_or_interpretation": "久留米大學2025/05/01公告：日語別科自2026年10月入學起停止招生，待在學生完成後廢止。東吳116學年度表仍列可修日語密集課程，兩者適用範圍有衝突；2027／2028交換是否另有日語課程須確認。此公告不代表一般學部／研究所交換全部取消。", "reason": "母校課程敘述與接待校停止別科招生公告衝突。", "source_url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "source_sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b", "source_locator": "2025/05/01 notice, Japanese and English main content", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-20T23:45:02.616341+00:00", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-20T23:50:38+00:00", "source_type": "official_host_and_mother_sources", "method": "bounded_admission_scope_comparison", "baseline_inventory": "output/data-verification-20261021/baseline", "whole_record_verified": false, "additional_sources": [{"url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/faculty/exchange-student/", "sha256": "20d7043317048c0c22a74bb749ea2dfb29e9bd9eb12ed51e7d670181f72b3318"}, {"url": "https://english.kurume-u.ac.jp/", "sha256": "a8a504e7a64aaf8c22ae022ac8d53ac863fb44a1e5b1e0c24883bacadb397306"}, {"url": "https://icae.scu.edu.tw/zh-hant/outbound-exchange/intl/2025-2026schools", "sha256": "88f14bff787da8c4dfb2b9f30777d3ab52cf6b76a01b826d61a7373f66277d63"}]}
{"review_id": "7e922fd55345e7115f228759eaae", "base_record_id": "159301888de2242f47aeb053", "pointer": "/applicability_note", "base_value": "東吳大學 116 學年度校級赴境外交換暨自費研修計畫於 2026/09/14 至 2026/11/16 中午 12:00 受理線上申請（一次甄選同時涵蓋 116-1 秋季班與 116-2 春季班），預計於 2026 年 12 月底前公告甄選結果。", "base_value_sha256": "a568ed9f1c2b16defc0556199e83ca3e30ec4c54b20a59aabc38fe92434255a3", "base_status": "needs_confirmation", "expected_value_or_interpretation": "東吳大學 116 學年度校級赴境外交換暨自費研修計畫於 2026/09/14 至 2026/11/16 中午 12:00 受理線上申請（一次甄選同時涵蓋 116-1 秋季班與 116-2 春季班），預計於 2026 年 12 月底前公告甄選結果。 久留米大學2025/05/01公告：日語別科自2026年10月入學起停止招生，待在學生完成後廢止。東吳116學年度表仍列可修日語密集課程，兩者適用範圍有衝突；2027／2028交換是否另有日語課程須確認。此公告不代表一般學部／研究所交換全部取消。", "reason": "提名與接待課程可選性分開確認。", "source_url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "source_sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b", "source_locator": "2025/05/01 notice", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-20T23:45:02.616341+00:00", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-20T23:50:38+00:00", "source_type": "official_host_and_mother_sources", "method": "bounded_admission_scope_comparison", "baseline_inventory": "output/data-verification-20261021/baseline", "whole_record_verified": false, "additional_sources": [{"url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/faculty/exchange-student/", "sha256": "20d7043317048c0c22a74bb749ea2dfb29e9bd9eb12ed51e7d670181f72b3318"}, {"url": "https://english.kurume-u.ac.jp/", "sha256": "a8a504e7a64aaf8c22ae022ac8d53ac863fb44a1e5b1e0c24883bacadb397306"}, {"url": "https://icae.scu.edu.tw/zh-hant/outbound-exchange/intl/2025-2026schools", "sha256": "88f14bff787da8c4dfb2b9f30777d3ab52cf6b76a01b826d61a7373f66277d63"}]}
{"review_id": "a24fb12e09f9e69b3153961a4421", "base_record_id": "b89b2db0743110a57de0ef1c", "pointer": "/campus_life_summary", "base_value": "第1學期（2027秋季學期）：約2027年8/9月至2028年1月；第2學期（2028春季學期）：約2028年2月至7月（實際研修時間依協議校行事曆為準）。\n學士、研究生。；多數課程以日語授課，學生可參加日語密集課程及一般學士班課程。｜依《東吳大學學生出境期間有關學業及學籍處理辦法》，交換學生於境外學校每學期至少應修習 1 門課程，返臺後至遲於開學 1 週內完成學分抵免（或申請不抵免學分）手續。", "base_value_sha256": "95064283a8951d7dd2b2d961fb79469ba82e87d92109ed15f74f5b3e4aa80e16", "base_status": "contradicted", "expected_value_or_interpretation": "久留米大學2025/05/01公告：日語別科自2026年10月入學起停止招生，待在學生完成後廢止。東吳116學年度表仍列可修日語密集課程，兩者適用範圍有衝突；2027／2028交換是否另有日語課程須確認。此公告不代表一般學部／研究所交換全部取消。", "reason": "母校課程敘述與接待校停止別科招生公告衝突。", "source_url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "source_sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b", "source_locator": "2025/05/01 notice, Japanese and English main content", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-20T23:45:02.616341+00:00", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-20T23:50:38+00:00", "source_type": "official_host_and_mother_sources", "method": "bounded_admission_scope_comparison", "baseline_inventory": "output/data-verification-20261021/baseline", "whole_record_verified": false, "additional_sources": [{"url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/faculty/exchange-student/", "sha256": "20d7043317048c0c22a74bb749ea2dfb29e9bd9eb12ed51e7d670181f72b3318"}, {"url": "https://english.kurume-u.ac.jp/", "sha256": "a8a504e7a64aaf8c22ae022ac8d53ac863fb44a1e5b1e0c24883bacadb397306"}, {"url": "https://icae.scu.edu.tw/zh-hant/outbound-exchange/intl/2025-2026schools", "sha256": "88f14bff787da8c4dfb2b9f30777d3ab52cf6b76a01b826d61a7373f66277d63"}]}
