{"review_id": "4837820f8fd28721cae4220d1838", "base_record_id": "b89b2db0743110a57de0ef1c", "pointer": "/student_guide_sections/4/points/0", "base_value": "學士、研究生。；多數課程以日語授課，學生可參加日語密集課程及一般學士班課程。｜依《東吳大學學生出境期間有關學業及學籍處理辦法》，交換學生於境外學校每學期至少應修習 1 門課程，返臺後至遲於開學 1 週內完成學分抵免（或申請不抵免學分）手續。", "base_value_sha256": "e5b7819652e2601fed2a7e44cf4ec8880a3a54249586142237aef1f8ce013500", "base_status": "contradicted", "expected_value_or_interpretation": "久留米大學2025/05/01公告：日語別科自2026年10月入學起停止招生，待在學生完成後廢止。東吳116學年度表仍列可修日語密集課程，兩者適用範圍有衝突；2027／2028交換是否另有日語課程須確認。此公告不代表一般學部／研究所交換全部取消。", "reason": "母校課程敘述與接待校停止別科招生公告衝突。", "source_url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "source_sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b", "source_locator": "2025/05/01 notice, Japanese and English main content", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-20T23:45:02.616341+00:00", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-20T23:50:38+00:00", "source_type": "official_host_and_mother_sources", "method": "bounded_admission_scope_comparison", "baseline_inventory": "output/data-verification-20261021/baseline", "whole_record_verified": false, "additional_sources": [{"url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/faculty/exchange-student/", "sha256": "20d7043317048c0c22a74bb749ea2dfb29e9bd9eb12ed51e7d670181f72b3318"}, {"url": "https://english.kurume-u.ac.jp/", "sha256": "a8a504e7a64aaf8c22ae022ac8d53ac863fb44a1e5b1e0c24883bacadb397306"}, {"url": "https://icae.scu.edu.tw/zh-hant/outbound-exchange/intl/2025-2026schools", "sha256": "88f14bff787da8c4dfb2b9f30777d3ab52cf6b76a01b826d61a7373f66277d63"}]}
{"review_id": "8bad4816b31b1d233596433d41d4", "base_record_id": "bafa74670ce72ebbe750c16c", "pointer": "/eligibility", "base_value": "開放對象：全校各學院系所（依姊妹校開放對應院系選課）（學士班大二（含）以上、碩士班、博士班（須於中原大學修畢至少二學期，不含當學期申請提早畢業生））｜申請條件：1. 大學部：TOEFL ibt-68, IELTS-6.0, PTE 47, Duolingo 100 overall 2. 研究所：TOEFL ibt-80, IELTS-6.5 3. GPA3.0以上｜中原大學校內門檻：歷年學業成績 GPA 達 3.0（含）以上或班排名前 30%（兩項符合其一即可；建築學系須班排名前 50% 且建築設計（一）至（六）及格）｜姊妹校要求：1. 大學部：TOEFL ibt-68, IELTS-6.0, PTE 47, Duolingo 100 overall 2. 研究所：TOEFL ibt-80, IELTS-6.5 3. GPA3.0以上", "base_value_sha256": "1340cf098068930e0fd563e4ae9711491e9ba5d6f02629c25d99d97d4f09ecec", "base_status": "needs_confirmation", "expected_value_or_interpretation": "當期國際第二梯次與大陸公告將GPA3.0列為必備；一般介紹及文件頁則列GPA3.0或歷年系排名前30%。僅靠排名能否替代GPA須向國際處確認，不能以百分制75分換算。國際公告另列建築系須系排名前50%及建築設計一至六全數及格。\n當期表列申請資格：大學部：TOEFL ibt-68, IELTS-6.0, PTE 47, Duolingo 100 overall\n研究所：TOEFL ibt-80, IELTS-6.5\nGPA3.0以上\n備註：研究生交換期限為一學期\n接待校大學部交換專區列TOEFL舊制iBT68且各科15、IELTS6.0且各科5.0或PTE47，部分科系較高；未列Duolingo。中原表列Duolingo100及研究所條件先保留為母校參考，其交換適用性與新TOEFL分制尚待核實。", "reason": "母校表與接待校交換專區的語言範圍不一致，保留原表並標出未核實項目。", "source_url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "source_sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620", "source_locator": "Undergraduate Exchange Admission Requirements > English Language Requirement", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-20T23:45:00.436394+00:00", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-20T23:50:38+00:00", "source_type": "official_host_and_mother_sources", "method": "bounded_admission_scope_comparison", "baseline_inventory": "output/data-verification-20261021/baseline", "whole_record_verified": false, "additional_sources": [{"url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/faculty/exchange-student/", "sha256": "20d7043317048c0c22a74bb749ea2dfb29e9bd9eb12ed51e7d670181f72b3318"}, {"url": "https://english.kurume-u.ac.jp/", "sha256": "a8a504e7a64aaf8c22ae022ac8d53ac863fb44a1e5b1e0c24883bacadb397306"}, {"url": "https://icae.scu.edu.tw/zh-hant/outbound-exchange/intl/2025-2026schools", "sha256": "88f14bff787da8c4dfb2b9f30777d3ab52cf6b76a01b826d61a7373f66277d63"}]}
