{"review_id": "94f3e397aa5cb8bc970c1ceaf85f", "base_record_id": "bafa74670ce72ebbe750c16c", "pointer": "/student_summary_zh/eligibility_points/0", "base_value": "開放學制與年級：學士班大二（含）以上、碩士班、博士班（須於中原大學修畢至少二學期，不含當學期申請提早畢業生）", "base_value_sha256": "044134dc7728030dd071d873ab82e5a60e0622b2d8e7640a0512e8056cdcc66d", "base_status": "needs_confirmation", "expected_value_or_interpretation": "當期國際第二梯次與大陸公告將GPA3.0列為必備；一般介紹及文件頁則列GPA3.0或歷年系排名前30%。僅靠排名能否替代GPA須向國際處確認，不能以百分制75分換算。國際公告另列建築系須系排名前50%及建築設計一至六全數及格。\n當期表列申請資格：大學部：TOEFL ibt-68, IELTS-6.0, PTE 47, Duolingo 100 overall\n研究所：TOEFL ibt-80, IELTS-6.5\nGPA3.0以上\n備註：研究生交換期限為一學期\n接待校大學部交換專區列TOEFL舊制iBT68且各科15、IELTS6.0且各科5.0或PTE47，部分科系較高；未列Duolingo。中原表列Duolingo100及研究所條件先保留為母校參考，其交換適用性與新TOEFL分制尚待核實。", "reason": "母校表與接待校交換專區的語言範圍不一致，保留原表並標出未核實項目。", "source_url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "source_sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620", "source_locator": "Undergraduate Exchange Admission Requirements > English Language Requirement", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-20T23:45:00.436394+00:00", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-20T23:50:38+00:00", "source_type": "official_host_and_mother_sources", "method": "bounded_admission_scope_comparison", "baseline_inventory": "output/data-verification-20261021/baseline", "whole_record_verified": false, "additional_sources": [{"url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/faculty/exchange-student/", "sha256": "20d7043317048c0c22a74bb749ea2dfb29e9bd9eb12ed51e7d670181f72b3318"}, {"url": "https://english.kurume-u.ac.jp/", "sha256": "a8a504e7a64aaf8c22ae022ac8d53ac863fb44a1e5b1e0c24883bacadb397306"}, {"url": "https://icae.scu.edu.tw/zh-h