{"review_id": "58872ca806979e9879694533f627", "base_record_id": "dd5b549d60677cc8dfb46ab7", "pointer": "/housing_info", "base_value": "獲雲科大國際事務處提名後，可依 匹茲堡州立大學 交換生簡章（Fact Sheet）與線上系統說明申請校內學生宿舍或校外國際學生公寓（學校簡章摘要：Quota for 2027 Spring semester: 3 Every student can choose one-semester or one-academic-year exchange. But the total quota is three. English Requirement TOEFL: 68 overall with 15 section scores IELTS: 6.0 overall with 5.）", "base_value_sha256": "f94bc7791d9cd31513fbc6eec3b051247ca717ae1b1dc161372393be13aed595", "base_status": "needs_confirmation", "expected_value_or_interpretation": "本輪尚未核實匹茲堡州立大學交換生可申請的宿舍、校外房源或床位保證；原欄混入名額與語檢摘要，已移出住宿資訊。", "reason": "名額／語檢摘錄不提供住宿證據；撤下未核實的住宿選項。", "source_url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "source_sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620", "source_locator": "Reviewed exchange admissions section does not establish housing arrangements", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-20T23:45:00.436394+00:00", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-20T23:50:38+00:00", "source_type": "official_host_and_mother_sources", "method": "bounded_admission_scope_comparison", "baseline_inventory": "output/data-verification-20261021/baseline", "whole_record_verified": false, "additional_sources": [{"url": "https://www.pittstate.edu/admission/international-admission-information.html", "sha256": "4641e2629525eaf7255f91a809e198a8c1301228e2fe7d645d06783b6c9a3620"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/news/681dae7b90eb8ed992d60d76/", "sha256": "06e27e357bf10138c8a899a5a089e595b3b143c99edae336e091a89d3a5e0a3b"}, {"url": "https://www.kurume-u.ac.jp/faculty/exchange-student/", "sha256": "20d7043317048c0c22a74bb749ea2dfb29e9bd9eb12ed51e7d670181f72b3318"}, {"url": "https://english.kurume-u.ac.jp/", "sha256": "a8a504e7a64aaf8c22ae022ac8d53ac863fb44a1e5b1e0c24883bacadb397306"}, {"url": "https://icae.scu.edu.tw/zh-hant/outbound-exchange/intl/2025-2026schools", "sha256": "88f14bff787da8c4dfb2b9f30777d3ab52cf6b76a01b826d61a7373f66277d63"}]}
